<speak>
<s>From <phoneme alphabet="ipa" ph="zʊhd">zuhd</phoneme> news, this is your briefing for <say-as interpret-as="date" format="dmy">18032026</say-as>.</s>
<break time="1s"/>
<s>Israeli forces struck Tehran on day twenty-seven of the Iran-Israel war, killing Ali <phoneme alphabet="ipa" ph="ˌlɑːrɪˈdʒɑːni">Larijani</phoneme> — the official simultaneously managing Iran's war strategy, a domestic crackdown that has killed thousands, and stalled nuclear negotiations.</s> <s>His son <phoneme alphabet="ipa" ph="mɔːrˈtɛzə">Morteza</phoneme> and an aide also died, making this the first Israeli strike to eliminate a figure of his seniority inside Iran itself.</s> <s>Iran's foreign minister says the state rests on institutions, not individuals — but no pragmatist of <phoneme alphabet="ipa" ph="ˌlɑːrɪˈdʒɑːni">Larijani</phoneme>'s standing exists to take his place.</s>
<break time="900ms"/>
<s>In politics.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>The nineteenth of March marks one year since Ekrem <phoneme alphabet="ipa" ph="ɪˌmɑːmoʊˈluː">İmamoğlu</phoneme> was imprisoned in Turkey, arrested the same day he was preparing to declare his presidential candidacy, having twice won the Istanbul mayoralty and polled ahead of President Erdoğan in hypothetical matchups.</s> <s>A Turkish court charged him with corruption — charges that appeared only after those surveys were published.</s> <s>His trial continues with no verdict date set, and Turkey's main opposition remains without its most prominent figure.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>China is investigating General <phoneme alphabet="ipa" ph="dʒɑːŋ joʊˈʃjɑː">Zhang Youxia</phoneme>, the second-ranked officer in the People's Liberation Army, as President <phoneme alphabet="ipa" ph="ʃiː dʒɪnˈpɪŋ">Xi Jinping</phoneme>'s anti-corruption drive now spans all five theatre commands — broader than any previous round.</s> <s>The army marks its centenary in August 2027, and the purge reaches officers at every level of the command chain simultaneously.</s> <s>Analysts warn it could hollow out command structures at the moment Beijing most needs them to appear credible.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>In a ruling with no precedent in continental football, an arbitration tribunal has stripped Senegal of the Africa Cup of Nations title and declared Morocco the winner — after the final had already been played and celebrated.</s> <s>No governing body had ever overturned a completed Cup final before this decision.</s> <s>The Africa Cup's governing body has not publicly explained what rule Senegal violated to justify forfeiture.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Japan arrives at the White House without goodwill to spare, the next major ally in the queue after the United States-China summit collapsed.</s> <s>Tokyo has already drawn Trump's anger by invoking its constitutional ban on overseas military operations to refuse deploying support ships to Hormuz.</s> <s>Trump is expected to demand investment pledges or tariff concessions in exchange for continued security commitments.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>A federal judge has ordered one thousand and forty-two Voice of America employees reinstated, ruling that the Trump administration's mass firing violated a law barring White House editorial control over the broadcaster.</s> <s>Kari Lake, Trump's appointee to lead the United States Agency for Global Media, had cut the staff last year.</s> <s>The administration is appealing — if it prevails, broadcasts reaching hundreds of millions of listeners in dozens of languages would go dark.</s>
<break time="900ms"/>
<s>On the economy.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Pakistan has ordered a crackdown on hawala networks — informal cash channels that bypass the banking system — as the Hormuz closure drains the country's foreign exchange reserves.</s> <s>At the same time, trade through the <phoneme alphabet="ipa" ph="kʊnˈdʒɛrəb">Khunjerab</phoneme> Pass in the <phoneme alphabet="ipa" ph="ˌkærəˈkɔːrəm">Karakoram</phoneme> mountains is hitting records, the high-altitude route to China now the only major corridor the war cannot reach.</s> <s>Traders await a promised tax exemption that has not yet arrived.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>HSBC is selling two and a half billion dollars in additional tier one bonds — the first new issue of these loss-absorbing instruments since the Iran war began on the twenty-eighth of February.</s> <s>No bank had dared issue them while the war's financial fallout was uncertain.</s> <s>If the offering is oversubscribed, markets will have declared the damage to the global financial system contained.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>South Korea's economy added two hundred and thirty-four thousand jobs in February, but all growth came from health care and transport while manufacturing shed positions for the twentieth consecutive month.</s> <s>Workers aged fifteen to twenty-nine lost one hundred and forty-six thousand jobs in the same period, pushing youth unemployment to a five-year high of seven point seven percent.</s> <s>No government stimulus targeting young workers has been announced.</s>
<break time="900ms"/>
<s>In science.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Scientists at CERN, the European particle physics laboratory, have confirmed a particle called <phoneme alphabet="ipa" ph="zaɪ siː siː plʌs">Xi-cc-plus</phoneme> — only the second double-charm baryon ever observed, four times heavier than a proton and carrying two heavy charm quarks where a proton carries none.</s> <s>It is the eightieth particle CERN has confirmed, and its existence was predicted by the Standard Model decades before the technology to find it existed.</s> <s>The discovery gives physicists their most direct test yet of how the strong nuclear force binds the heaviest quarks together.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Physicist Astrid <phoneme alphabet="ipa" ph="ˈaɪkhɔːrn">Eichhorn</phoneme> argues the universe needs no hidden dimensions, no strings, and no supersymmetric particles — only the physics we can already observe.</s> <s>Her framework, called asymptotic safety, holds that space-time turns fractal at the smallest possible scales, stabilising gravity without new ingredients.</s> <s>If its next predictions survive experimental test, it would become the first serious challenger to string theory in decades.</s>
<break time="900ms"/>
<s>In technology.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>The Pentagon declared Anthropic, an artificial intelligence safety company, a national security risk after it refused to remove guardrails preventing autonomous weapons use and domestic surveillance.</s> <s>Defence Secretary Pete <phoneme alphabet="ipa" ph="ˈhɛɡsɛθ">Hegseth</phoneme> announced the blacklisting on the third of March; Anthropic is challenging the designation in court.</s> <s>If the government prevails, it would mean any company that refuses to weaponise its artificial intelligence systems can be shut out of the United States economy entirely.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>The cryptocurrency industry spent ten million dollars targeting a Democratic frontrunner in Illinois's Senate primary — and lost cleanly.</s> <s>Fairshake, the sector's super political action committee, ran advertising against Juliana Stratton, who won and enters November's general election owing the crypto lobby nothing.</s> <s>It is the latest sign that concentrated outside spending cannot reliably reshape electoral outcomes, even in a single primary contest.</s>
<break time="1s"/>
<s>That's your briefing from <phoneme alphabet="ipa" ph="zʊhd">zuhd</phoneme> news.</s>
</speak>